{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT</p><p>流浮山雞伯嶺路鳳降村一個貨倉，今日（17日）下午1時15分發生火警，火勢猛烈並冒出大量濃煙。消防接報到場撲救，至下午1時29分將火勢級別升為三級，動用2條喉2兩隊煙帽隊灌救。據報現場貨倉面積約30米乘30米，數十人疏散，​火警中暫未接獲受傷報告。</p><p>消防處呼籲，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，可關閉門窗並保持鎮定。</p><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/453ffabef63d2deaae9a7eaf16039329/2026-09/813765504_18127885591792420_3276074044553230610_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fae3ccbac4f019c09ce7ef82f494d9b/2026-09/813837177_18127885573792420_1711786208498473556_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"​ Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4698455e69853faece4983541ed6cbf5/2026-09/813322804_18127885678792420_4705542540147120156_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c19ea61c783495255f210de143751990/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_14_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aaad7ab9ad8fab6f299106b77defea0b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_14_48.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T06:40:00.823161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}